{"id":"4ed6f28789f0aa57","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-degree-join.md","title":"Join of Turing Degrees","display":"df-degree-join — Join of Turing Degrees","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-degree-join","aliases":["68-df-degree-join"],"display":"df-degree-join — Join of Turing Degrees","depends_on":["[[68-df-effective-join]]","[[68-df-turing-degree]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 proposition 15.1 p.54 / PDF 63; local binary formulation","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"well-definedness-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-degree-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-degree-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-join — Join of Turing Degrees"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1d430cdc0e4cc29\" href=\"?note=e1d430cdc0e4cc29\" title=\"68-df-effective-join\">68-df-effective-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 proposition 15.1 p.54 / PDF 63; local binary formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"well-definedness-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg\">\\(\\deg\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a>，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e1d430cdc0e4cc29\" href=\"?note=e1d430cdc0e4cc29\" title=\"68-df-effective-join\">68-df-effective-join</a>。以下重载 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 的参数均为度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b:=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A\\oplus B):A\\in\\mathbf a\\land B\\in\\mathbf b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b:=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A\\oplus B):A\\in\\mathbf a\\land B\\in\\mathbf b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 A≡_T Ã、B≡_T B̃，按查询的奇偶性分别调用相应归约，即得 A⊕B≡_T Ã⊕B̃。因此右侧集合族只有一个元素，取并给出唯一的度。它的最小上界性质由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1391f74d0e8dd998\" href=\"?note=1391f74d0e8dd998\" title=\"68-thm-degree-structure-theorem\">68-thm-degree-structure-theorem</a> 明确陈述。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-effective-join","status":"resolved","id":"e1d430cdc0e4cc29","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-effective-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D$，$\\deg$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合 $\\oplus$ 见 [[68-df-effective-join]]。以下重载 $\\oplus$ 的参数均为度。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-effective-join","status":"resolved","id":"e1d430cdc0e4cc29","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D$，$\\deg$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，集合 $\\oplus$ 见 [[68-df-effective-join]]。以下重载 $\\oplus$ 的参数均为度。","embed":false},{"target":"68-thm-degree-structure-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若 A≡_T Ã、B≡_T B̃，按查询的奇偶性分别调用相应归约，即得 A⊕B≡_T Ã⊕B̃。因此右侧集合族只有一个元素，取并给出唯一的度。它的最小上界性质由 [[68-thm-degree-structure-theorem]] 明确陈述。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\oplus\\mathbf b:=\\bigcup\\{\\deg(A\\oplus B):A\\in\\mathbf a\\land B\\in\\mathbf b\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1116,"backlinks":[{"id":"bc06a64193b5ff40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D$，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]。$\\mathrm{Split}$ 的参数顺序为两个分支、被分裂的度。"},{"id":"1391f74d0e8dd998","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal D,\\mathbf0$ 见 [[68-df-turing-degree]]，度序见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]，度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]，度跳跃见 [[68-df-degree-jump]]。跳跃性质见 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"d10c661122833e3a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，度序与 $\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 见 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]] 的上游；度 join 见 [[68-df-degree-join]]；不可比性见 [[68-df-incomparable-degrees]]。稠密性部分依赖尚待来源核验的 [[68-thm-re-degree-density]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-join|df-degree-join — Join of Turing Degrees]]"}],"outgoing":["e1d430cdc0e4cc29","43fcc2f44ce938e0","1391f74d0e8dd998"]}